        <item>
            <title>0.19.4</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 23:49:14 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1904</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.19.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.4</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Jarvis lives in the notch while he takes notes.</b> The floating
      "listening" pill is gone. While a meeting records, Jarvis sits beside
      the notch with a red dot and the time. Hover or click him for Pause and
      Stop &amp; save. On a screen without a notch he hangs from the middle of
      the menu bar.</li>
  <li><b>"Take notes?" asks from the notch.</b> When you join a call, Jarvis
      offers one button. Press it and he starts at once; ignore it and the
      ring round him runs out after five seconds and nothing is recorded.</li>
  <li><b>Stop &amp; save just saves.</b> No more "resume or discard?" step
      after you press it.</li>
  <li><b>No more "Need a hand on this call?"</b> Joining a call shows only the
      take-notes question.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
